msgid "Write `report.py`. Run as"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/project.md:30
msgid "it writes `out/portfolio_report_2026-09-30.xlsx` and `out/portfolio_2026-09-30.png`, and prints a short summary with the checks. With `2026-08-31` (or any month end from 2025-10-31 to 2026-09-30) it makes the report of that month."
msgstr ""

